Vendored NVIDIA codec headers for DVBStreamer5 hardware transcoding.

Upstream: https://github.com/FFmpeg/nv-codec-headers
Upstream tag: n13.0.19.1
Video Codec SDK: 13.0.19
Minimum NVIDIA Linux driver: 570.0

Reason for pinning 13.0:
- DVBStreamer5 targets Pascal/Maxwell systems that may use NVIDIA 570/580 drivers.
- nv-codec-headers 13.1 requires NVIDIA Linux driver 610.0 or newer.
- The headers are build-time only; CUDA/NVDEC/NVENC shared libraries are loaded dynamically at runtime.

Vendored files:
- include/ffnvcodec/nvEncodeAPI.h
- include/ffnvcodec/dynlink_cuda.h
- include/ffnvcodec/dynlink_cuviddec.h
- include/ffnvcodec/dynlink_nvcuvid.h

Each upstream header retains its original NVIDIA/MIT-style copyright and permission notice.
